T:Stingo
G:dance song
M:6/8
L:1/8
Q:3/8=108
K:GMin
G2G d2B   |cA2 F2F |G2G  d2B|G3 B3:|
B2B B2A/B/|c2c c2c |d2d  g2g|d3 f3 |
B2B B2A/B/|c2c c>de|dc>B cA2|G3 B3|]

